ypeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Metamagic_Empowered_Spell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Metamagic_Empowered_Spell.webp/300px-Metamagic_Empowered_Spell.webp, /w/images/c/c9/Metamagic_Empowered_Spell.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Metamagic_Empowered_Spell.webp/300px-Metamagic_Empowered_Spell.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Metamagic_Empowered_Spell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Metamagic: Empowered Spell</b>  is a toggleable passive feature used by <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>. This <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic\" title=\"Metamagic\">Metamagic</a> ability allows sorcerers to reroll damage dice when using a damaging spell.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Increase the cost of spells that deal direct damage by 1 <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/30px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/40px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcery_Point\" title=\"Sorcery Point\">Sorcery Point</a> to roll their damage with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>.\n<br><br>\nYou can use Empowered Spell in combination with other <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic\" title=\"Metamagic\">Metamagic</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/30px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/40px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcery_Point\" title=\"Sorcery Point\">Sorcery Point</a></span> </dd><dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p><p>Not available through normal gameplay.\n</p>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201330\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 818/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7658/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2361/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usa